sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Visiteur (Navigateur)
    participant B as Bannière RGPD
    participant F as Frontend (ProfileClient)
    participant API as API Analytics (Next.js)
    participant RPC as Fonction RPC (Postgres)
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    V->>F: Accède à la page de profil
    F->>B: Vérifie le consentement (LocalStorage)
    alt Pas de consentement
        B-->>V: Affiche la bannière
        V->>B: Accepte ou Refuse
    end

    F->>API: POST /api/analytics/track (profile_viewed)
    API->>DB: INSERT into analytics_events

    alt Visiteur scanne QR / NFC
        F->>API: POST /api/analytics/track (qr_scanned)
        API->>DB: INSERT into analytics_events
    end

    alt Visiteur clique sur un lien
        V->>F: Clic sur le lien
        F->>API: POST /api/analytics/link-click
        API->>RPC: increment_link_click(link_uuid)
        Note over RPC: Sécurité: SECURITY DEFINER contourne le RLS pour l'update direct
        RPC->>DB: UPDATE links SET click_count = click_count + 1
        API->>DB: INSERT into analytics_events (Asynchrone)
    end

    alt Visiteur quitte la page (>2s)
        V->>F: Ferme l'onglet ou navigue
        F->>API: navigator.sendBeacon('/api/analytics/track', time_spent)
        API->>DB: INSERT into analytics_events
    end
